    <title>
        feat(anp_qa): accept tags: header and split detail
    </title>
    <updated>2026-09-11T00:37:16Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289839794?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>spencerjamesstewart</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/spencerjamesstewart</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(anp_qa): accept tags: header and split detail

Skip an optional leading &amp;#39;tags:&amp;#39; line (deck tags still come from the
driver). Split answers on the first &amp;#39;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;&amp;#39; into a short lead and an
&amp;#39;Additional info&amp;#39; detail; move detail to note for key_list and pairwise
compare cards, which do not render detail.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 &amp;lt;noreply@anthropic.com&amp;gt;
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qj1AdqM9S9Az2fCN1oJC41&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
