    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: add reusable Q:/A: deck driver

Extracts the parser, HTML escaping, override merging, and the five
self-checks that were duplicated byte-for-byte across two gitignored
batch drivers. Batch drivers now supply only an OVERRIDES table and a
generate() call.

Verified behavior-preserving: regenerating the chapters 4-6 deck through
this module reproduces the previously shipped file byte-for-byte.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
