    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: add medical-terminology card generator driver

Add gen_medterm.py, which parses the abbreviations and glossary source
files into three validated Anki decks (word parts, abbreviations,
eponyms), merging duplicate fronts and deduping globally.

Point the INSTRUCTIONS.md output rule at pwd/outbox/ and gitignore the
outbox/ directory so generated batches never get committed.&lt;/pre&gt;
