    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(run)!: retire the deployment model

Cowork sessions now point directly at the working repo, so run.sh no
longer manages git state: the update subcommand, do_update(), and the
dirty-tree check are removed. Docs drop the _tools read-only-clone
layout and document that drivers and decks live outside the repo.

BREAKING CHANGE: ./run.sh update no longer exists&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
