    <title>
        feat: add run.sh, deck validator CLI, and docs
    </title>
    <updated>2026-07-03T06:33:12Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289839794?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>spencerjamesstewart</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/spencerjamesstewart</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat: add run.sh, deck validator CLI, and docs

Deliverables from flashgen-build-spec.md:
- run.sh: update (ff-only, fails on dirty/diverged), validate, sample
- anki_templates.py: generalize _self_check into validate_deck(path),
  add argparse CLI (--validate, --list-types), subject-neutral docstring
  pointing at CATEGORIES as the type source of truth
- INSTRUCTIONS.md: universal card-authoring rules (versioned header)
- README.md: deployment model and usage
- .gitignore: keep the generated sample deck from dirtying the clone

Generated sample output verified byte-identical to pre-change engine.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
