    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/spencerjamesstewart/anki-template-engine/commit/f8deb6aa38fcd4044cd0ddb966ad476cc8b2febc"/>
    <title>
        feat(builders): add ethics, true/false, and drug-name card types
    </title>
    <updated>2026-06-23T03:19:45Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289839794?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>spencerjamesstewart</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/spencerjamesstewart</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;feat(builders): add ethics, true/false, and drug-name card types

Add six card builders to the engine and register them in CATEGORIES
and the dispatcher:

- argument    (ARGUMENT,          indigo)
- position    (POSITION,          gold)
- objection   (OBJECTION &amp;amp; REPLY, rose)
- distinction (DISTINCTION,       purple)
- true_false  (TRUE / FALSE,      slate)
- drug_name   (DRUG NAME,         gold)

Extend PALETTE with slate (#8f9aa6) and rose (#e0728c), and document
the new categories in the module docstring.

Additive only; no existing builder, helper, or output format changes.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
